ndent 4,5-Didodecylphthalic acid exchange. Follow oleate release; quantities, duration and temperature are unreported. Table1 ranges summarize several preparations and exchange sequences, not one uniquely identified batch. Continue additions until no further sharpening of the free oleic-acid NMR signal is observed. Proceed to this branch output. Conceptual source-linked material flow; unreported geometry is not inferred.","source_locator":"Main PDF p.3, printed 7370"},{"operation_id":"quantify-oleate","asset_path":"assets/protocol/chambrier2015-porphyrin-cdse-5b00892-small-ligands-quantify-oleate.svg","asset_sha256":"feea6b4d8a818abedc0bc0955b5b647c7cfdec39009ee439389e8f3e0917cfb1","caption":"Main p.3 describes a known ferrocene internal standard and integration of the bound-oleate resonance for as-prepared particles; standard amount is not restated. Separately, other exchanged-ligand coverage is assessed after purification and quantitative thiolate displacement, but exact per-ligand purification schedules and numerical release conditions are not supplied in the admitted main. Table1 ensemble measurements retain general-context links. Proceed to this branch output. Conceptual source-linked material flow; unreported geometry is not inferred.","source_locator":"Main PDF p.3, printed 7370"},{"operation_id":"compete-without-base","asset_path":"assets/protocol/chambrier2015-porphyrin-cdse-5b00892-small-ligands-compete-without-base.svg","asset_sha256":"dfc176c2ebd04de910158c9b2a54b8bb1c4c94f053100881c063fd508e671e91","caption":"Independent equimolar DDT/phosphonic-acid competition without NEt3. Exact ligand doses, duration and elemental-analysis technique are unreported. Proceed to this branch output. Conceptual source-linked material flow; unreported geometry is not inferred.","source_locator":"Main PDF p.3, printed 7370"},{"operation_id":"compete-with-base","asset_path":"assets/protocol/chambrier2015-porphyrin-cdse-5b00892-small-ligands-compete-with-base.svg","asset_sha